    "title": "Treasure Hunting by the Sea: The Super Scenic 150 Mile Garage Sale Returns! - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Danielle Anderson ,\n1 hours ago St. Augustine, Fla. – Start your engines and grab your shopping bags—it’s time to cruise for bargains! The Friends of A1A Scenic & Historic Coastal Byway, Inc. are thrilled to announce the return of the legendary Super Scenic 150 Mile Garage Sale on Saturday, November 15, 2025, celebrating its 17th year along Florida’s most breathtaking coastal highway. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
